{
  "id": "reversing-interlock",
  "order": 14,
  "level": 3,
  "plant": "reversing",
  "title": {
    "es": "Inversión de giro con enclavamiento",
    "en": "Reversing with interlock"
  },
  "statement": {
    "es": [
      "Un motor gira hacia ADELANTE (Q0.0) o hacia ATRÁS (Q0.1) con dos contactores. Los pulsadores ADELANTE (I0.0) y ATRAS (I0.1) arrancan cada sentido con autorretención; PARO (I0.2, NC) detiene el motor.",
      "Nunca pueden estar los dos contactores cerrados: sería un cortocircuito. Para cambiar de sentido primero hay que parar. El relé térmico TERMICO (I0.3, NC, lo maneja la planta) también detiene el motor."
    ],
    "en": [
      "A motor turns FORWARD (Q0.0) or in REVERSE (Q0.1) with two contactors. The FORWARD (I0.0) and REVERSE (I0.1) push buttons start each direction with a seal-in; STOP (I0.2, NC) stops the motor.",
      "The two contactors must never be closed at the same time: it would be a short circuit. To change direction you must stop first. The OVERLOAD relay (I0.3, NC, driven by the plant) also stops the motor."
    ]
  },
  "io": [
    {
      "address": "I0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "ADELANTE",
        "en": "FORWARD"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador de giro adelante (NA)",
        "en": "Forward push button (NO)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "ATRAS",
        "en": "REVERSE"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador de giro atrás (NA)",
        "en": "Reverse push button (NO)"
      },
      "mode": "button-no"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.2",
      "name": {
        "es": "PARO",
        "en": "STOP"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pulsador de paro (NC: 1 en reposo)",
        "en": "Stop push button (NC: 1 at rest)"
      },
      "mode": "button-nc"
    },
    {
      "address": "I0.3",
      "name": {
        "es": "TERMICO",
        "en": "OVERLOAD"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Relé térmico (NC, planta)",
        "en": "Overload relay (NC, plant)"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.0",
      "name": {
        "es": "KM_ADELANTE",
        "en": "KM_FORWARD"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Contactor de giro adelante",
        "en": "Forward contactor"
      }
    },
    {
      "address": "Q0.1",
      "name": {
        "es": "KM_ATRAS",
        "en": "KM_REVERSE"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Contactor de giro atrás",
        "en": "Reverse contactor"
      }
    }
  ],
  "allowed": ["NO", "NC", "coil"],
  "hints": {
    "es": [
      "Empieza con dos circuitos de marcha con autorretención, uno para cada sentido, ambos con PARO y TERMICO en serie.",
      "El enclavamiento eléctrico es un contacto NC del contactor contrario en serie: si KM_ATRAS está cerrado, KM_ADELANTE no puede energizarse, y al revés.",
      "Peldaño 1: (ADELANTE O KM_ADELANTE), PARO, TERMICO, NC KM_ATRAS → KM_ADELANTE. Peldaño 2: igual con ATRAS y NC KM_ADELANTE → KM_ATRAS."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Start with two start circuits with seal-in, one per direction, both with STOP and OVERLOAD in series.",
      "The electrical interlock is an NC contact of the opposite contactor in series: if KM_REVERSE is closed, KM_FORWARD cannot be energized, and vice versa.",
      "Rung 1: (FORWARD OR KM_FORWARD), STOP, OVERLOAD, NC KM_REVERSE → KM_FORWARD. Rung 2: the same with REVERSE and NC KM_FORWARD → KM_REVERSE."
    ]
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "Gira adelante y no acepta ATRAS mientras gira",
        "en": "Runs forward and ignores REVERSE while running"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1500,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1700,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1600,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 2000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "Parando se puede cambiar de sentido",
        "en": "After stopping, the direction can change"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.0": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.2": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1200,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.2": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1500,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1700,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 800,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1400,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 2000,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": {
        "es": "El relé térmico detiene el motor",
        "en": "The overload relay stops the motor"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "at": 100,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 300,
          "inputs": {
            "I0.1": false
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1000,
          "plant": "overload"
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "at": 800,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.1": true
          }
        },
        {
          "at": 1300,
          "outputs": {
            "Q0.0": false,
            "Q0.1": false
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
